# Shared Component Imports

Always use the `@/shared/components` path alias when importing shared components. Never use relative paths that traverse into the `shared/` directory.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
import { Button } from '../../shared/components/button';
import { Navbar } from '../../../shared/components/layout/navbar';

// ✅ GOOD
import { Button } from '@/shared/components/button';
import { Navbar } from '@/shared/components/layout/navbar';
```

This applies to all imports from the `shared/` directory, not just components:

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
import { formatDate } from '../../../shared/utils/date';

// ✅ GOOD
import { formatDate } from '@/shared/utils/date';
```
